mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Ask[Tell me about a project] --> Q1{Can you name your pack?}
  Q1 -->|No| Shrink[Pick a smaller slice you owned]
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Do you have a metric?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Cite[Cite it with source: report ticket UAT]
  Q2 -->|No| Honest[Say unknown; offer a qualitative check]
  Cite --> Q3{What did you not choose?}
  Q3 -->|Nothing| Risk[You sound like there was no trade-off]
  Q3 -->|Named alternative| Trade[State why: security speed cost]
  Trade --> Q4{Lesson?}
  Q4 -->|Blame others only| Weak[Add what you would pack differently]
  Q4 -->|Changed your practice| Strong[Close with that change]
